<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><title>Coverage Gaps</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/menu') %>
<h1>Fields vs Weather Coverage Gaps (v_sensor_days)</h1>
<p>FULL OUTER JOIN as LEFT JOIN UNION RIGHT JOIN - MySQL has no FULL OUTER JOIN. UNION not UNION ALL.</p>
<table border="1" cellpadding="5">
<tr><th>Field ID</th><th>Field Name</th><th>Log Date</th><th>Type</th></tr>
<% coverage.forEach(c=>{ %>
<tr>
<td><%= c.field_id || 'NULL' %></td>
<td><%= c.field_name || 'N/A' %></td>
<td><%= c.log_date || 'NO DATE' %></td>
<td><%= c.coverage_type || (c.log_date ? 'both' : 'field only') %></td>
</tr>
<% }) %>
</table>
</body>
</html>
